{"server":"tw","storyId":"act12side_level_act12side_03_end","groupId":"act12side","stageId":"act12side_03","title":"拔銃相助","storyCode":"DH-3","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"3e4188c2cded3b586e4eea18265fe763006dd7d374707fd171f19e303c2b38e4","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"為了答謝陳，水月將自己的金塊送給了陳。\n而後，陳與林雨霞繼續搜索線索無果，最終順利晉級。","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"太驚人了，陳女俠，先是殺入巷子中救下被圍攻的水月選手，然後直接在巷子中與其他參賽選手對峙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"其他隊伍看來也已經認定鼠膽龍威隊是個巨大的威脅，非常默契地達成了聯手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"但是即使如此，陳女俠也絲毫不懼，選擇與他們開戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"真是一場酣暢淋漓的戰鬥！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我們也不能忘記在巷子的另一邊，林女俠的戰鬥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"和陳女俠在巷子中激烈的戰鬥不同，林女俠在巷子口僅憑幾招就威懾住了趕來的其他隊伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"這次大獎賽中，真的有能夠戰勝這個組合的隊伍存在嗎？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，這兩個人果然還是適合各打各的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，Missy，你猜老陳和林小姐對打的話，誰會贏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"問這個幹嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是很感興趣啊，兩個很厲害的人放一起，一般都會想知道誰更厲害吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有你才會這麼想吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正我不知道，今天是我這幾年第一次看到這個女人真的出手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？你不是和林小姐關係很好嗎，這都沒見過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰和她關係好啊，整天神神秘秘的，有的時候電話都打不通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且誰說熟了就一定要看過對方動手啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也有道理，看來是我跟老陳相處習慣了。老陳現在想贏我可不能只靠她那套劍法了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別把所有人都當成你們倆好不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說了，我沒見過才好，我怕哪天我見到的時候就是要抓她的時候了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有道理，畢竟是那位鼠王的女兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，不過也不能這麼說，那位也不是什麼壞人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛來龍門混的時候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，我又不是沒見過鼠王，還用你告訴我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你明白就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起這個，你剛才用了“混”字吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧我，在詩大小姐面前說粗話，該掌嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你和老陳就見過她出手啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這不是沒有才來問你嘛，老陳我估計也沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一點你說得倒是沒錯，沒見過她出手對我們這種立場的人是好事，不然熟歸熟，該做的少不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我也沒想到，居然會有老陳和她聯手的一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是活久了什麼都能見到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說回剛才的話題，所以你覺得誰會贏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"懶得猜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，那我自己猜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要我說，老陳要是拿著劍，林雨霞大概很難近她的身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，要是讓林雨霞近了身，老陳就輸定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陳這麼菜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不能這麼說，老陳的拳腳功夫肯定是不差的，擒拿、關節技什麼的，我們平時培訓的她都做得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看她剛才打的，她用銃準頭也不差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是老陳畢竟拿手的是劍術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_197_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的意思是林雨霞的拳腳功夫相當於老陳的劍術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陳暉潔，逞英雄開心嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不怎麼開心，不過也不用你操心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，陳小姐，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說了，你在那裡等我就好，你做得沒有問題。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水月","speakerId":"avg_437_mizuki_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你幫了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"客氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水月","speakerId":"avg_437_mizuki_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，你為什麼要幫我呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不為什麼，看到了，就幫了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水月","speakerId":"avg_437_mizuki_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣啊。姐姐你是個好人呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水月","speakerId":"avg_437_mizuki_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然這樣，給。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......赤金？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水月","speakerId":"avg_437_mizuki_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我剛才就是想拿這個才被他們圍住的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給我們沒關係嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水月","speakerId":"avg_437_mizuki_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，我再去找就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水月","speakerId":"avg_437_mizuki_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我本來就不是很在乎比賽，能夠認識陳姐姐這樣的好人，對我來說已經很滿足了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提醒一下，這裡已經驚動了不少隊伍，想聊天可以，別在這裡停留太久比較好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水月","speakerId":"avg_437_mizuki_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就先走啦，拜拜~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑且問一下，你那邊除了逞英雄還有什麼收獲嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赤金不算收獲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒什麼特別的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，繼續？還是交了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先繼續吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，親愛的觀眾們，我這邊剛才已經收到了二十塊赤金全部提交的資訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，第一輪比賽到此圓滿結束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，接下來，我們將開啟投票環節。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"投票環節將持續幾個小時，在結束後，我們將在主舞台公佈第一輪的出線隊伍，不要錯過！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下還有觀眾投票環節，不過以兩位現在的人氣，肯定是不會有問題的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過看起來林小姐也沒有找到危險分子的有關線索？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這邊沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那有可能確實不存在這樣的人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陳暉潔，等下有空？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找你有事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
